  "catalyst_orders_enabled": false,
  "extended_hours_enabled": true,
  "notes": "2026-09-23 after-hours paper E2E of the extended-hours session path (user: paper is never gated). Same numeric limits as config-sip.json 77244c39 (1 share, 1x, loss/drawdown 25 USD, quote age 3 s, spread 15 bps). Universe and regime basket narrowed to after-hours-liquid names from SIP samples at 18:5x ET (QQQ and META fresh 8/8 at 3 s; SPY 3/8, NVDA 3/8; IWM and DIA 2/8), because RiskLimits caps quote age at 3 s. A mechanics E2E, not a strategy evaluation; its own state root because the durable ledger refuses config changes.",
  "sessions": {
    "extended_hours": true,
    "overnight_holds": false,
    "overnight_gross_multiple": "1.0"
